      "value": "@{60285ca04963ba22994f485b|full_name}: No, I don't use anything fancy. As I mentioned its single layer in TPose animator, with single blend tree as visible, with single animation, with same thing in the FX layer. No drivers, single float param controlled directly by menu and blend tree.\n\nQuickly copied the animators and removed everything else than this one feature using TPose layer: avtr_85c32584-fe40-42c9-817b-05562444e8e9 you can just move the slider in the menu and then try to calibrate on live and beta to see a difference - on live the trackers should still align with the avatar, on beta it will be like on the picture.",
