  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Recent beta seems to change how avatar init works, I have animation on my TPose layer that was just scaling my avatar based on single float, but now when my avatar reload or i click calibrate that animation is ignored resulting in incorrect behaviour.\n\nSo when i try to calibrate my trackers no longer match my avatar for example.\n\nSeems to also work differently without fullbody and then it applies animation correctly, making it very inconsistent. \n\nI use this on every avatar and now bascially can't play the game in FBT.\n\nSecond picture is my TPose layer, where each animation just scales avatar to different sizes based on single float param.",
